    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kepuo iltung'ana le Nkai aaku iloo loshon pooki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nji ejo Olaitoriani: “Embung'a esipata niasiasa nena sidain, amu kelotu enjeunoto ai asieku, ore enkordunoto ai neibalunyeki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emayiana ilo tung'ani oas ena, o enkerai e tung'ani naibung akurraki, ilo oibung sabato, nemeisarkionie, neibooyo enkaina enye pee meas entorroni ake pooki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchoo ilo leeiking'a oeuo aibung'are Olaitoriani ejo, “Esipa kaakepu nanu Olaitoriani too ltung'ana lenyena.” Naa nchoo ake mejo ilo sunash ogelema, “Ng'ura, ara nanu olchani otoyio.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu nji ejo Olaitoriani: “Ore lelo sunaishi oogelema ooibung sabato ai, lelo oogelu mbaa naaitiship nanu neibung aakurraki olning'o lai lo sotua, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa kalo nanu aisho ti atua enkaji ai o ti atua isunta e nkaji ai, entoki nadamunyeki sidai nalang ilayiok o ntoyie; kaisho nanu ninche enkarna oo ntarasi nemeiwuang'ieki ae kata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore lelo tung'ana leeiking'a oopuonu aaibung'are Olaitoriani, pee esiaai ninye, pee enyorru enkarna o Laitoriani, pee eaku isinkan lenyena, ore pooki ng'ae ooibung sabato, nemeisarkionie ninye, neibung olning'o lai lo sotua akurraki ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.21.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 21.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.11.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 11.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.19.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 19.46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ore kulo nariku nanu ilo doinyio lai sinyati naisho nanu ninche meting'idata ti atua ina aji ai e nkomono; ore lelo asarri lenye oopejori o nkishorunot enye, naa kepuoi aang'amaa te nchumata ilo perere lai lo lasar; amu kepuoi aajo enkaji ai enkaji enkomono too loreren pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai, ilo oiturrur lelo apa ooiturrayioki le Israel, kaigil nanu aiturrur kulikae te nebo lelo ooidipaki aaiturruro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etudung'okoki enkiguana ilarikok loo Siraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'uesi kuna pooki e ong'ata wootu enosa - o intae na ng'uesi e ntim pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aimodook ilarripok lenyena naa ilmoda pooki; ildiein oomoda ninche pooki, meidim aatabuak, ooidetidet eirrag oonyor aaimugo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeta lelo diein enkuli kitok, meraposho ae kata ninche. Ore sii lelo shekuti naa kemoda; eibelekenyakinote pooki nkoitoi enye maate, oltung'ani enkoitoi enye nadupore, neijia eikuna pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninche, ‘Wootu’, maatook enaisho, maitaraposho ate enaisho napi; ore taisere naa ketiu anaa ena olong, keaku kitok alus.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
